  "notes": "A four-wheeled quad bike on the kart's handling model (src/vehicle/kart.rs), tuned from the heavy kart: about the same pace and feel, but bigger, heavier and taller, with knobbly tyres on long soft travel so its wheels roll up voxel steps (climb 0) instead of meeting them as kerbs. It flies further than a kart (less stick, a bigger hop) and in the air its nose is pulled air_tilt degrees up over the ground below, so the rear wheels touch first and the landing settles onto the front. Runs over shrubs as the buggy does (game.rs crush_shrubs). The default vehicle of a world that lists none.",
